## What NOT to Change

| Component | Reason |
|-----------|--------|
| Handler pattern in `graph/` | Well-structured, serves as template |
| `JackService` singleton | Excellent implementation |
| `ConfigManager` dirty-flag pattern | Works well, minimizes disk I/O |
| `ConnectionHistory` | Clean 79-line implementation |
| Protocol interfaces | Good foundation for testability |

